-- Daily quiz bank, lot 3: 20 quizzes for 2026-12-03 to 2026-12-22 (Mission U, owner 2026-10-15).
-- OWNER-GATED: apply only after the review of this lot (every title and 25% of the questions,
-- plus everything lint-lot.mts flagged). Generated by apps/quiz/scripts/daily-bank/to-sql.mts.
-- Rollback: daily-bank-2026-12-lot3-rollback.sql (removes only rows of this lot not yet published).
